      "overview": {
        html: `
<div class="overview-content" data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>
<h2 class="overview-title" data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>ROLL AROUND. COLLECT BANANAS. BECOME THE ORB MASTER.</h2>
<p class="main-description" data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Ball Race is all about having fun with the physics engine. You&#39;re placed inside an orb (ball), which you roll around in to collect bananas for points.</p>
<div class="sections" data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>
<div class="section-item" data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>
<h3 data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Travel across different worlds</h3>
<p data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Travel across different worlds full of puzzles and obstacles to reach the end. Get past tricky situations such as crushers, lasers, lava, and falling objects.</p>
</div><div class="section-item" data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>
<h3 data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Unique Puzzles</h3>
<p data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Each world has its own theme and set of puzzles. Carefully roll around and try not to fall off. Difficulty of level varies from level to level. Some puzzles may require you to press buttons, memorize, jump (using the environment), timed events, and many other things.</p>
</div><div class="section-item" data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>
<h3 data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Simple Gameplay</h3>
<p data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Controls are as easy as we can make them. You use your basic movement keys (WASD) to move around in the ball. You have complete control over the camera position (even zoom ability). All of the gameplay is designed with new players in mind. Everyone will be able to keep up with the crowd, giving a fair balanced game.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="game-info" data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>
<div data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Gameplay: Physics-based Puzzle</div>
<div data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Players: 8 players (4 required)</div>
<div data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Flow: One World</div>
<div data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Mood: Happy</div>
<div data-astro-cid-c4jkbc26>Multiplayer: Yes</div>
</div>
</div>
`
      },
